<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span><span id="S4.T1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Accuracy comparison on search-intensive and agentic tasks.</span> 7B-Base refers to Qwen-2.5-7B-Base and 7B-Inst refers to Qwen-2.5-7B-Instruct. AutoGen and our <span id="S4.T1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AgentFlow</span> method are agentic systems, which use Qwen-2.5-7B-Instruct for the LLM-powered agents and tools for fair comparison.
We visualize the gains of <span id="S4.T1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AgentFlow</span> to the each baseline in the <span id="S4.T1.10" class="ltx_text"><math id="S4.T1.m35" class="ltx_Math" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D4F2D7;" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#D4F2D7;" mathbackground="#D4F2D7" mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.T1.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D4F2D7;"> columns</span></span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
