</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.24 12.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.98em;--ltx-fo-height:57.83em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="800.26" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 800.26)" width="525.54"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.98em;">
<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Description:<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> A web search tool powered by Google Search that provides real-time information from the internet with citation support.</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Input:<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> query: str - The search query to find information on the web.</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Input:<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> add_citations: bool - Whether to add citations to the results. If True, the results will be formatted with citations. By default, it is True.</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Output:<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> str - The search results of the query.</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Demo Commands:<span id="A5.SS2.SSS3.p1.pic1.p3.5.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A5.I21" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I21.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"> 
