<span id="A6.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool:</span><span id="A6.I5.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A6.I5.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Python Coder</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Sub-goal:</span><span id="A6.I5.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Generate and test all possible arithmetic expressions using the numbers [1, 1, 6, 9] exactly once to check if any combination equals 24.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I5.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Command:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.I5.i3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.I5.i3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">tool.execute(query="Using the numbers [1, 1, 6, 9], create an expression that equals 24 using basic arithmetic operations and parentheses.")</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Result:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="239.53" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 507.86 239.53" width="507.86"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,239.53) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F0F8FF;" fill="#F0F8FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 238.15 C 0 238.91 0.62 239.53 1.38 239.53 L 506.48 239.53 C 507.24 239.53 507.86 238.91 507.86 238.15 L 507.86 1.38 C 507.86 0.62 507.24 0 506.48 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EFFFE5;" fill="#EFFFE5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 238.15 C 0 238.91 0.62 239.53 1.38 239.53 L 506.48 239.53 C 507.24 239.53 507.86 238.91 507.86 238.15 L 507.86 1.38 C 507.86 0.62 507.24 0 506.48 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 4.15 2.77)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.38em;--ltx-fo-height:17.41em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="243.69" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 240.92)" width="475.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.38em;">
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter"># Given numbers
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">numbers = [1, 1, 6, 9]
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter"># Calculate the expression
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">result = (numbers[0] + numbers[1]) * (numbers[3] - numbers[2])
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter"># Print the result
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i4.p2.pic1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">print(f"The result of the expression (numbers[0] + numbers[1] ) * (numbers[3] - numbers[2]) is: result")
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I5.i4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The result of the expression (1 + 1 ) * (9 - 6) is: 6</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.SS2.p3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS2.p3.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Action Step 2: Tool Error<span id="A6.SS2.p3.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A6.I6" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
