</span></span>
<span id="A6.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I6.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Sub-goal:</span><span id="A6.I6.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Generate and test all possible permutations of the numbers with different operator placements to find an expression that equals 24.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
