</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.SS3.p4.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS3.p4.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Execution Verifier:<span id="A6.SS3.p4.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A6.SS3.p4.pic1.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">STOP, Initial Tool Failure &amp; Inefficient Search Path</span></span></span></span>
