<span id="A6.I24.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I24.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Sub-goal:</span><span id="A6.I24.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Retrieve the Tropicos ID of the Order Helotiales from Wikipedia.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I24.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
