</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.24 15.01)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.98em;--ltx-fo-height:5.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="76.03" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 73.26)" width="525.54"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.SS7.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.98em;">
<span id="A6.SS7.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS7.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A6.SS7.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Who is the mother-in-law of Olivera Despina?</span></span></span>
<span id="A6.SS7.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS7.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Answer:<span id="A6.SS7.p2.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Gülçiçek Hatun</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A6.SS7.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.SS7.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="995.44" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 995.44" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,995.44) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#228B22;" fill="#228B22" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 2.77 L 0 992.67 C 0 994.2 1.24 995.44 2.77 995.44 L 547.23 995.44 C 548.76 995.44 550 994.2 550 992.67 L 550 2.77 C 550 1.24 548.76 0 547.23 0 L 2.77 0 C 1.24 0 0 1.24 0 2.77 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EFFFE5;" fill="#EFFFE5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 2.77 L 1.38 938.63 L 548.62 938.63 L 548.62 2.77 C 548.62 2 548 1.38 547.23 1.38 L 2.77 1.38 C 2 1.38 1.38 2 1.38 2.77 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 947.41)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.91em;--ltx-fo-height:3.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="46.16" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 42.7)" width="441.54"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.SS7.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.91em;">
